# Cockpit's pkg/lib is vendored at build time (package.nix postPatch, or
# `npm run vendor:lib` locally); a copy may exist for editor/tsc runs but must
# not be committed. Singular `pkg` is Cockpit's own name, not our pkgs/ tree.
